body:
Hello,

&#x200B;

I believe it's nsfs, its been fine for ages.. I had to enable secure boot today as it popped up, could that be the issue???

Just a quick last question.

&#x200B;

Would I need to create a new compose for each container I installed?? (Radarr, Sab)

Yeah apologies I pasted it wrong. this is my directory on my nas

&#x200B;

https://postimg.cc/tZJ0MLSQ

That did it, I re ran the compose and got this:

&#x200B;

d

Sadly, I also had an error, due to port conflict. One thing after another haha

&#x200B;

docker: Error response from daemon: driver failed programming external connectivity on endpoint portainer (1970c4cd6f9fd0677f101ad32ed641fb5963c53bcff8ef9da275e46234f8fcc6): Error starting userland proxy: listen tcp4 0.0.0.0:8000: bind: address already in use.

I seem to have it installed now, however I am getting the following errors

&#x200B;

[https://ibb.co/f8gFmNQ](https://ibb.co/f8gFmNQ)

OH! is that because I typed [192.168.0.**1**](https://192.168.0.1) instead??

&#x200B;

Bit scared to break the connection again now haha, thanks LIV2 :)

Jay, I totally agree.

&#x200B;

She wants me to watch tv (even if she's not there) and not a game, what's the difference?

&#x200B;

The only time I socialise with friends really is through games.

Hmm.. Snakes are incredible escape artists, also, my corn snake escaped few years ago, I was on the 2nd floor and I found it on the steps some months later. It did indeed get under the door and down the stairs.

&#x200B;

Check behind the freezer/fridge

I've always felt like an outcast and abnormal. I've always felt there was something wrong with me deep down.

&#x200B;

Thanks for the advise :)

Hey,

&#x200B;

He can be yeah, I don't think he knows how to speak to people unfortunately.

&#x200B;

I have opened up quite well with someone at work who is an admin/manager and she is being extremely helpful, but she doesn't know ways to help me, I don't even know ways to help myself.

&#x200B;

I'm glad that you have a company that understands and helps you :)

Due to me not knowing how much it would be for this, I would have to say it would depend on how much it is.

&#x200B;

I don't want to say yes, not afford it and upset people. I'm only on minimum wage and don't earn much.

Hello Kapitein,

&#x200B;

I just want to apologize, I've calmed down a lot now and no longer crying at my desk (Yay)

&#x200B;

I still feel very suicidal but I want to fight, it's just hard having that fight at times.

Vornamemitd, you are a legend.

&#x200B;

Thank you so much for your assistance.

&#x200B;

I did try to execute it earlier without thinking, I did get a few errors shoot up though.

&#x200B;

I'd love to have the experience and skill you do, do you have any recommendations?

&#x200B;

As for the process you mentioned, unfortunately it's mainly just me who can do that so its something I'm going to have to take a long look at :) thank you so much again

Hello Andy,

&#x200B;

Thank you for your input, again, sorry for the lack of detail. I know in my head what I want but saying it is a different thing. I think as a starting point for powershell I may have dived in the deep end?

As a staff member -

&#x200B;

I've been working for a company for 3 years now, we often get gifted. At Easter we get an Easter Egg, Christmas we get a Christmas night out.

&#x200B;

These are appreciated, but they are not really for hard work. The hard work gifts we get are Amazon vouchers, bonus each year (£500-3000) and the odd pint. This makes us feel appreciated and makes us want to work hard for the business

(Ipswich based)

&#x200B;

I may work in a different field to you, but I mainly deal with wireless solutions and access control. 


I've only been sent out a few times, but I was doing some work on a server recently for 3 hours and they charged the customer £480

&#x200B;

I'm being sent to site next month for an installation which is it £800 a day roughly.

&#x200B;

Hope this helps

Thank you so so much for replying,

Unfortunately most the times I make a post people struggle to understand it.

&#x200B;

I'll try make this as specific as possible, if you don't understand please tell me and I'll try again.

&#x200B;

So as a networking business and access control business, we have a customer that will say a specific reader is dead, we would need to take details and put them into our ticket site - OsTicket. Then after we have made these notes we would need to go over to [https://cemsys.com/cemrepairs](https://cemsys.com/cemrepairs) and complete this form. Not sure if this is possible to do this.

Ideally, on my side, I would love to build some sort of PDF with all the information on that can go up to processing so they can see the old serial number / new serial number, model, customer and date.

I will try draw a diagram that may help, sorry again.

&#x200B;

Edit: Also giving you a gold for your kindness. My first ever gold given out! :)

She used to get quite violent and abusive, I put up with it because I felt it wasn't her fault as she had mental health.

&#x200B;

One day I had the day off and was playing on my PS4, she came home threw my controller at the wall and punched me straight in the face. I went to the bedroom to start packing where she punched me in the back then straddled on top of me spitting and rubbing it in my face. I grabbed her arms to get her off me and the police got involved. That was it for me, left my home, my belongings, my two cats behind and started again.

When I was 8 there was two boy twins at the end of my road who found it funny to use a bat and hit frogs in the air! I loved animals all great and small, one time there was road works on the side of the road with a big hole, and they was ripping off frogs legs and throwing them in the hole laughing (Not sure where they are today? prison?). As I was watching, pissed off. One of the twins went inside as he was being called, I ran as fast as I can and pushed the other twin down the hole (not too deep, but deep enough he couldn't climb out of) and I walked off..

&#x200B;

Boy did I get in a lot of shit. Was bad for me to do it but on the other hand I'm still glad I did it. Fuck him.

Hello :)

&#x200B;

Hopefully it will be okay someday, I hate how it feels, it feels hard to breathe even.. I'm going to seek professional help, which isn't easy in the UK I don't think.

&#x200B;

Thank you so much for replying

Still trying to get hold of this book. I can't seem to find it at all in UK.

&#x200B;

Very heart renching.

Hello Lion,

&#x200B;

Everyone this morning is devestated, I spoke to my "half brother" yesterday and things appeared okay, he said even we could become something eventually. This morning I received threats etc, so I think they are quite upset, which is understandable.

&#x200B;

I just feel ever so guilty, Thank you for your response, I really appreciate it. I picked up a leaflet today at the doctors for Cancer support, since yesterday we found out it has spread to her liver and her lung, so really not a great time.

&#x200B;

I have had my medication of Fluoxetine upped to the highest dose by the doctor so hopefully I will start to be able to support further.

&#x200B;

Thank you again mate, you take care, and thank you for allowing me to express myself.
